  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "Tr\u1EADn v\xE2y h\xE3m Hoa L\u01B0 kh\xE9p l\u1EA1i, nh\u01B0ng d\u01B0 \xE2m
      c\xF2n in h\u1EB1n trong l\xF2ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi. D\xF9 gi\u1EEF v\u1EEFng
      ch\xED l\u1EDBn, nh\u01B0\u1EE3ng b\u1ED9 \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EE9u con, hay d\xF9ng
      m\u01B0u k\u1EBF \u0111\xE1nh \xFAp, k\u1EBFt c\u1EE5c v\u1EABn l\xE0 \u0110inh
      Li\u1EC5n c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng v\xE0 Hoa L\u01B0 v\u1EABn \u0111\u1EE9ng v\u1EEFng."
    - "Nh\u01B0ng b\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi \xE1nh l\u1EEDa chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng v\u1EABn
      l\xE0 b\xF3ng \u0111en c\u1EE7a m\u1EA5t m\xE1t. M\xE1u \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1ED5,
      ni\u1EC1m tin \u0111\xE3 th\u1EED th\xE1ch, v\xE0 s\u01A1n h\xE0 n\xE0y c\xE0ng
      hi\u1EC3n l\u1ED9 m\u1ED9t ch\xE2n l\xFD: con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng t\u1EDBi
      b\xE1 nghi\u1EC7p s\u1EBD kh\xF4ng c\xF3 b\u01B0\u1EDBc n\xE0o m\xE0 kh\xF4ng
      nhu\u1ED9m x\u01B0\u01A1ng m\xE1u v\xE0 s\u1EF1 hy sinh."
